config FREETZ_PACKAGE_DOMOTICZ_SYSFS_SWITCHES
	bool "Domoticz plugin: GPIO switches via sysfs"
	depends on FREETZ_PACKAGE_DOMOTICZ
	default n
	help
		expose the GPIOs of the system in Domoticz as switches, reading and writing the sysfs filesystem (it reaches the GPIOs through sysfs and needs no additional Python module).

		It is a Python plugin of Domoticz: the package installs it into
		/usr/share/domoticz/plugins/SYSFS-Switches, the directory Domoticz is
		started with (-approot of the domoticz package), and it needs no
		change of the Domoticz build.

		Setup -> Hardware -> SYSFS-Switches, name the GPIOs to expose.

		Licensed upstream (LICENSE is installed with the plugin). The
		repository has no release tags, so the build fetches a pinned commit of
		the default branch.
